  "details": "Description: Exiting Chair in Standing Mode while avatar is not on full height will swap Seated Play Mode's.\n\nRepro Steps: Change \"Seated Play Mode\" into \"Standing Mode\".\nCrouch to any lower height.\nSit and Exit the Chair.\nNow you are in \"Seated Mode\" despite the icon showing Standing Mode and you Crouching.\nIf you switch back into \"Seated Mode\", the game will treat it as \"Standing Mode\" and make avatar crouch at your current position.\n\nThe only way to fix it is switch to broken \"Seated Mode\" and sit&exit Chair again.",
